   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 4.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For Jesus died and rose again",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.8,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And he will raise them all",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 3.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And so we shall be with the Lord",
   "heard": 8,
